factcheck by groq/qwen/qwen3.8-27b: 2 problems
  Missing important fact: The reel_script omits the specific mention of the 'ஆவத்திப்பாளையம் தலைமை நீரேற்று நிலையம்' (Aavathipalayam Head Water Supply Station) as the source for the 10 km supply, referring to it only as 'ஆவத்திப்பாளையம் நீரேற்று நிலையம்' (Water Supply Station), whereas the article explicitly identifies it as a 'Head' station (தலைமை நீரேற்று நிலையம்) alongside Puliagavundampatti.
  Missing important fact: The reel_script does not explicitly state that the opinions are being collected from 'councillors and the public' (கவுன்சிலர்கள் மற்றும் பொதுமக்கள்) to send the complete report to the government, although it mentions the report being sent, it lacks the specific detail of who is being consulted in that specific sentence structure, though the previous sentence implies it. However, a more significant omission is that the script says 'திட்டம் தயாராகிறது' (scheme is being prepared) at the end, while the article says the detailed project report is already prepared ('தயார் செய்யப்பட்டுள்ளது') and the scheme for daily supply is to be prepared ('தயார் செய்யபட உள்ளது'). The script conflates the status of the DPR and the operational scheme.
